  "bodyHash": "eb8104a7880a95ab",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">需要&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" rel=\"nofollow\">神化</a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheotic-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神化附加</a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ancient-reforging\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">古代重铸</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模组添加了异界锻造台，可使用神化附加添加的稀有度（神器、传家宝、神秘）进行锻造。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">This mod adds an esoteric reforging table that can be reforged at additional rarities (Artifact, Heirloom, Esoteric) by Apotheotic Additions.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f1c40f\">不包含异界锻造台的合成配方。<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f1c40f\">Recipe for creating Esoteric Reforging Table not included.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5d7cbcda-9e63-469f-b9d6-d39dd2341bcc.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>异界锻造台可以像神化的锻造台一样，为物品附加最高至神秘稀有度的词缀。</p>\n<p>它会消耗神化附加提供的稀有度材料。</p>\n<p>The Esoteric Reforging Table, like the Apotheosis Reforging Table, can grant Affixes of up to Esoteric rarity to items.</p>\n<p>It consumes Apotheotic Additions rarity material.</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bad90522-7548-4c39-8ccf-d7486d05ba98.png\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>致谢：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shadows_of_fire/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shadows_of_Fire</a> 的神化</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ianm1647/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ianm1647</a> 的古代重铸</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/bryce792/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">bryce792</a> 的神化附加</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
